Updated [RecordDetailView.tsx](/Users/anjitha/Downloads/bug-fix-evals/work/t3-reaction-rollback/packages/app-shell/src/views/RecordDetailView.tsx) so each click updates the UI immediately and queues a save per comment. Saves no longer run inside a React state updater, avoiding duplicate writes from updater replays. If a save fails, the user sees an error toast and the UI returns to the most recently confirmed reaction state.

I left tests untouched and did not run them.
